abstract: "Software prototypes for local/adaptive dynamics, endogenous collective feedback, constant-amplitude projected admissibility, and their combined feedback-followed-by-projection model with state-dependent relational geometry. Comparative scientific adequacy and feedback-projection equivalence remain unverified."
